<title>FRANCE: Rhone to sell French soda/chlorine/bleach.</title>
<headline>Rhone to sell French soda/chlorine/bleach.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Rhone-Poulenc said on Tuesday it planned to sell 50 percent of its French operations in the production and marketing of chlorine, soda and bleach to U.S. firm LaRoche Industries and create a joint venture with the latter.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the move was part of its strategy of focusing its business portfolio on specialty and service-based chemical activities.</p>
<p>It did not reveal a price.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
